\label{lemma-catenary-S2-equidimensional}
\begin{reference}
\cite[IV Corollary 5.10.9]{EGA}
\end{reference}
Let $A$ be a Noetherian local ring which is catenary and $(S_2)$.
Then $\Spec(A)$ is equidimensional.
